{"4982910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interlude", "steam_appid": 4982910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interlude is a roguelike exploration game where every run takes you through a different story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a double progression loop that combines classic roguelike elements - permadeath, randomized abilities and builds, and fast upgrade - with a more persistent exploration and adventure structure that lets you unlock new parts of the dungeon on each run. <br><br>It's also a lot bigger than it seems...</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interlude is a roguelike exploration game where every run takes you through a different story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features a double progression loop that combines classic roguelike elements - permadeath, randomized abilities and builds, and fast upgrade - with a more persistent exploration and adventure structure that lets you unlock new parts of the dungeon on each run. <br><br>It's also a lot bigger than it seems...</p>", "short_description": "A roguelike dungeon crawler where each room is a different world inspired by classical painting. Dying brings you back to your starting point, but the upgrades you unlock, the friends you make, and the secrets you uncover will help you explore further each time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4982910/b6c92b25117dcbb9f62618e2cb26cf7c3a5bae73/header.jpg?t=1786960218", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4982910/ad4ac997b5d3eec09b88330c786cfe59b61c2092/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786960218", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4982910/ad4ac997b5d3eec09b88330c786cfe5